cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "gridqueue"
abstract: >-
  Harmonizer of statutory grid-connection disclosures for the electricity network.
  Turns the documents published under Article 7(8l) of the Polish Energy Law
  and the corresponding registers from other jurisdictions into a single set of rows in a 21-field
  schema derived from the structure of the legal obligation.
type: software
version: "1.2.1"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-matysik/gridqueue"
url: "https://s-matysik.github.io/gridqueue/"
keywords:
  - grid connection
  - statutory disclosures
  - data harmonization
  - document extraction
  - open energy data
authors:
  - name: "gridqueue contributors"
